WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.711 --> 00:00:05.161
<v Maya>Can Pip learn from me?

2
00:00:05.621 --> 00:00:10.037
<v Ms. Nova>Yes! Press Start Copy me. When you move the leader arm, the follower copies you.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.193
<v Ms. Nova>With pretend arms, these sliders are your hand on the leader. Let's turn the base.

4
00:00:16.465 --> 00:00:18.214
<v Maya>It copies me, like a mirror!

5
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.584
<v Ms. Nova>Now record a demo. Press Record, move slowly, then press Save.

6
00:00:28.293 --> 00:00:30.191
<v Maya>I saved my first demo!

7
00:00:30.664 --> 00:00:37.640
<v Ms. Nova>Great job! Record five demos of the same task, starting from the same spot, so the robot brain can learn it.
